          ],
          "content": "N 61"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.088,
            0.401,
            0.109
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "4.2.3 Velocity-time graphs"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.111,
            0.776,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "The velocity-time graph of an object in motion represents the change in its velocity with time. In a manner similar to the position-time graph, you can plot velocity-time graphs following the steps of Activity 4.3."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.166,
            0.51,
            0.251
          ],
          "content": "Let us take the example of a car moving in the same direction on a straight stretch of a highway at a steady velocity of 72 km $\\mathrm { h } ^ { - 1 }$ or $2 0 \\; \\mathrm { { m } \\; s ^ { - 1 } }$ The velocity-time graph corresponding to it is shown in Fig. 4.17a."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.253,
            0.509,
            0.339
          ],
          "content": "Consider another car that starts moving from rest and its velocity increases with time as shown in Table 4.5. The velocity-time graph plotted for this case is shown in Fig. 4.17b."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.341,
            0.509,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": "Consider yet another car moving with a velocity of 15.0 m $\\mathbb { S } ^ { - 1 }$ . Its velocity decreases with time as shown in Table 4.6 and its velocity-time graph is shown in Fig. 4.17c."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.517,
            0.211,
            0.727,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Time</td><td rowspan=\"2\">Velocity of car</td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td>0 s</td><td>0 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td>5 s</td><td>2.5 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td>10 s</td><td>5.0 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td>15 s</td><td>7.5 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td>20 s</td><td>10.0 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td>25 s</td><td>12.5 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">30 s</td><td rowspan=\"2\">15.0 m s<sup>-1</sup></td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table>",
          "captions": [
